   - Flag error
   - Discard current packet
   - Scan for next valid [1000]
   - Resync and continue

[0110]: D=0, P=110
→ Skipped (in error recovery)

[1000]: D=1, P=000
→ DELIMITER found! ✓
→ Resync successful
→ Resume normal processing

