- Mixed bases supported (flexible)
Tables Made of Different Encoding Forms:
Table structure with mixed encodings:

Table: "User Records"

Columns:
| ID (Hex) | Name (UTF-8) | Age (Decimal) | Flags (Binary) |

Row 1:
| 0x0001   | "Alice"      | 42            | 1010          |
