- Mixed encodings per column (flexible)
- Relational structure (queryable)

LAYER 6: PAGES
- Collection of tables (hierarchical)
- Temporal windows (time-bound)
- Merkle tree validated (integrity)
- Left-shifting (temporal)

LAYER 7: SECTIONS/DOCUMENTS
- Collection of pages (complete)
- All-TRUE logic (validated)
- ÷13 truth states (harmonic)
- Time-dependent (dynamic)

All built on:
