#:;:;...;...  (first 15 symbols, 2 bits each)

Where:
':' = 00
';' = 01
',' = 10
'.' = 11

So:
: ; : ; , , , . . .  . . .  ...
00 01 00 01 10 10 10 11 11 11 ... (rest unused)
↓──────↓──────↓──────↓─────↓
Rsvd   Sizes   ELF   Assertions

