Statistics: Information entropy H_A
Usefulness: Purpose P_A

STREAM B (inverted, bit 0 = 1):
Data: [1010101010...]
Meaning: Departure mode interpretation
Statistics: Information entropy H_B
Usefulness: Purpose P_B

The EQUALITY:
- Numerically: |A| = |B| (same information content)
- Semantically: Meaning_A ≈ Meaning_B (equivalent purpose)
- Statistically: H_A = H_B (equal entropy)
- Usefulness: P_A = P_B (equal utility)

Why equal:

1. NUMERICAL:
   - Same bit count (length)
   - Complementary patterns (1↔0)
