Example center-seeking route:
(-1,-1,-1) → (0,-1,-1) → (0,0,-1) → (0,0,0) CENTER!
   ↑           ↑           ↑           ↑
Corner      Edge        Face      CENTER DATA

Leader marks: "Center has important data!"
Workers process: Each reads center data
Consensus: All agree on center value
