LEFT-TO-RIGHT (forward):
Byte B borrows from Byte A (previous)
[A7][B6-B0] = 9-bit value for B

RIGHT-TO-LEFT (backward):
Byte A borrows from Byte B (next)
[B7][A6-A0] = 9-bit value for A

