  - Set color
  - Allocate space
Output: Context prepared
Memory: RELEASE 9-bit value (freed!)

PHASE 2: Process content (7-bit)
Input: Receive 7-bit value ('H' = 72)
Memory: Store in 7-bit register
Action: Place content in prepared space
  - No lookup needed (context set)
  - Immediate rendering (ready)
Output: Content displayed
Memory: RELEASE 7-bit value (freed!)

